---
import ServicePage from "../../layouts/ServicePage.astro";
import { business } from "../../data/business.js";
---
<ServicePage
  slug="boiler-installation"
  photoCategory="Boilers"
  title="Boiler installation"
  description={`New boiler installation across ${business.region}: combi, system and conventional boilers fitted neatly by a Gas Safe registered engineer. Free quotes.`}
  intro="Whether your old boiler has given up or you're upgrading, we'll recommend the right boiler for your home and fit it neatly, with pipework you'd be happy to have on show."
>
  <h2>What's included</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>A visit to look at your home, your hot water needs and where the boiler should go</li>
    <li>Honest advice on combi, system or conventional boilers and the right size for your home</li>
    <li>Old boiler removed and the new one fitted to the manufacturer's instructions</li>
    <li>Heating system flushed and protected with inhibitor, as manufacturers require</li>
    <li>Everything tested, commissioned and explained to you before we leave</li>
    <li>Installation registered with Gas Safe, so you get your Building Regulations compliance certificate</li>
    <li>Help registering the manufacturer's warranty</li>
    <li>On renovations and longer jobs, a photo report at first fix, second fix and handover</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Tidy installations</h2>
  <p>A boiler is something you'll live with for years, so we fit it as if it's on show: pipework run straight and clipped, and the area cleaned up afterwards, cupboard included.</p>

</ServicePage>
